text = "MOVEMENT
Space - Dodge Roll: brief invincibility while rolling, costs stamina
COMBAT
LMB / RMB - Attack: chain hits within 0.6s to reach COMBO 2 and the FINISHER
Q - Ranged Attack: fires a projectile in your facing direction, costs mana
F - Parry: deflect a hit and knock the attacker back, no damage taken
STAMINA
Powers attacks and dodge rolls. Regenerates after a short pause.
MANA
Powers your ranged attack. Refills at a bonfire or on a kill.
HEALING GOURD
H - Heal: limited charges, can be interrupted (wasting the charge) if hit
BONFIRE
Press E to rest: full heal, refill stamina/mana/charges, set your respawn
QUICK TRAVEL
1 - Forest   2 - Green Forest   3 - Undead Forest   4 - Boss Arena
DEBUG
\\ - God Mode: no damage, unlimited stamina, mana and heals
PAUSE
Escape - pause the game, respawn, return to the first level, or quit
Press I again to close"
label_settings = ExtResource("3_body1")
horizontal_alignment = 1
vertical_alignment = 1
